Package: jtb2026
Title: Keyword and Semantic Search Over Tabular Data
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R:
    person("yh202109", , , "yh202109@google.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Find the rows of a table that mention something. Reads an
    Excel workbook, a delimited file, or an in-memory data frame, then
    returns the subset of rows whose selected columns match a search term.
    Two matchers are provided: an exact/regular-expression keyword search,
    and a scoring semantic search that ranks rows by TF-IDF cosine
    similarity with optional synonym expansion, fuzzy character n-gram
    matching, or a user-supplied embedding function. Either search can
    write its result straight to a CSV file.
